<title>USA: Strouds Inc amends $40 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Strouds Inc amends $40 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc said Friday it has agreed to amend the terms and conditions of its $40 million credit facility.</p>
<p>The terms will be changed to reflect anticipated earnings and cash flows over the remaining term of the credit facililty, which expires Jan. 13, 2000, the company said.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to provide greater detail.</p>
<p>Strouds is a retailer of home textiles with 67 stores in five states, it said.</p>
